flyleaf (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The packages 0.2.2 never got. That entry named the wrong day of the week,
    which lintian refuses, and a pushed tag cannot be re-cut. Nothing a person
    using the editor will notice has changed since; 0.2.2's entry below is
    what this carries.

